    "enUS": {
      "description": "This barrel is small yet sturdy.  Its seams are sealed with a yellow, pungent wax.  Stamped on the bottom of the barrel are the words:\n\nQUARTERMASTER LUNGERTZ\n\nNETHERGARDE KEEP",
      "dialogue": {
        "35670805e29f8562584b": "You have something for me?",
        "ee0321a2acd321786a0d": "Ah, thank you $N!  So many supplies are lost from Darkshire to here.  It's good to see that some are recovered."
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Lost Supplies to Quartermaster Lungertz.",
      "title": "The Lost Supplies",
